    ('Reconciliation/report/export','Filters/scope/time basis, actual source coverage, units/denominators/currencies and missing-data disclaimer; export full fixed authorized selection','Explicit field/scope export grant; no private case count or credential disclosure','Generated snapshot stable; formula-safe CSV/text handling preserves Arabic/names; report is not a restorable backup'),
